{"id":"91bfa9b664aabf49","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dnc-fpf.md","title":"DNC与不动点自由计算能力等价","display":"thm-dnc-fpf — DNC与不动点自由计算能力等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dnc-fpf","aliases":["43-thm-dnc-fpf"],"display":"thm-dnc-fpf — DNC与不动点自由计算能力等价","depends_on":["[[43-df-dnc]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Lemma 5.19.1, print pp.72–73 / PDF pp.92–93","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dnc-fpf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dnc-fpf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnc-fpf — DNC与不动点自由计算能力等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 5.19.1, print pp.72–73 / PDF pp.92–93"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span>为总自然数函数。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)]\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[g\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(g)]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)]\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[g\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(g)]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>s-m-n把对角回避转成单元素c.e.集的编号回避；反向通过有限模拟挑选与本程序输出不同的编号行为。严格比较的是计算能力，不要求同一函数同时DNC和FPF。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 5.19.1, print pp.72–73 / PDF pp.92–93。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)]\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;[g\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{FPF}(g)]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dnc-fpf]] — DNC与不动点自由计算能力等价"},{"id":"1677d7f7248ffdaa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["323b0a74dc337ecf","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}